Keep the bulk of the Qwen3 vision tower's weights in host RAM, under a
dedicated budget, so the visual path costs host memory instead of VRAM.

Registers VLLM_VISION_CPU_OFFLOAD_GB (GiB, 0 disables) and reads it through
vllm.envs, so the knob is part of the torch.compile cache key.

